#  ██╔══██╗██╔══██╗████╗  ██║██╔════╝██║     ██╔══██╗██╔════╝
#  ██║  ██║███████║██╔██╗ ██║█████╗  ██║     ██║  ██║███████╗
#  ██║  ██║██╔══██║██║╚██╗██║██╔══╝  ██║     ██║  ██║╚════██║
#  ██████╔╝██║  ██║██║ ╚████║███████╗███████╗██████╔╝███████║
#  Stock Artix ISO (base-dinit), Connected To Wi-Fi Or Ethernet. As Root:
